[{"ave_id":"AVE-2003-0068","file_name":"2003/AVE-2003-0068.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2003-0246","title":"Linux Kernel ioperm 系统调用权限提升漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 2.4.20 及更早版本中的 ioperm 系统调用未能正确限制进程权限，导致本地普通用户可调用 ioperm() 获取对特定 I/O 端口的读写访问权限。攻击者利用此漏洞可绕过权限检查直接操作硬件设备，进而实现权限提升或敏感信息泄露。攻击前提是拥有本地系统访问权限，无需身份认证即可触发。","severity":"LOW","score":3.6,"aliases":["CVE-2003-0246"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-06-16T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:01:49Z","remediation":"立即升级 Linux 内核至 2.4.21 或更高版本，该版本已修复 ioperm 系统调用权限检查不严的问题。如无法升级内核，可通过 SELinux 或 grsecurity 等强制访问控制机制限制本地用户调用 ioperm 的权限，或在系统层面移除不需要的 setuid 二进制文件以降低本地提权风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2003-q2/0076.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=105301461726555&w=2","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-311","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-312","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-332","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-336","http://www.debian.org/security/2004/dsa-442","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2003:066","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2003:074","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-147.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-172.html","http://www.turbolinux.com/security/TLSA-2003-41.txt","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A278","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27584df20575115093a915d82c76b5107dd9d51e/cves/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0246.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2003/CVE-2003-0246","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2003-0246","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2003-0246","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/2880bce38b1c3fec315752297be30e3d60dabff9/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2003-0246","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c31c0a9b9af147bd58078ebf7769418f19d3f2e1/CVE/data/2003/CVE-2003-0246.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1d7706ed603ab73481cbc20e5bea092e02e7c9be/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0246.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/c6500283f68defe11c86dcd41d1529288a6fc9b1/2003/CVE-2003-0246.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2003/CVE-2003-0246.json","https://github.com/mssalvatore/ubuntu-cve-tracker-mirror/blob/393245887b9fdc3ecd3096a44e0373d9fb7038a6/retired/CVE-2003-0246"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2003/AVE-2003-0068.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2003-0062","file_name":"2003/AVE-2003-0062.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2003-0195","title":"CUPS IPP 部分请求超时拒绝服务漏洞","description":"CUPS（Common Unix Printing System）1.1.19 之前版本存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向 IPP 端口（631）发送部分打印请求，由于服务端未对该类不完整请求设置超时机制，导致连接被长期占用，最终耗尽系统资源造成拒绝服务。攻击无需身份认证，攻击复杂度低，影响运行 CUPS 的各类 Unix/Linux 系统。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2003-0195"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-06-16T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:01:43Z","remediation":"升级 CUPS 至 1.1.19 或更高版本。Red Hat 用户安装 RHSA-2003:171 提供的更新包，Debian 用户应用 DSA-317 安全更新。如无法升级，可在防火墙上限制对 631/TCP 端口的访问，仅允许受信任 IP 连接，或禁用 CUPS 的远程 IPP 打印功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000678","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=105427288724449&w=2","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-317","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2003:062","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2003_028.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-171.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/7637","http://www.turbolinux.com/security/TLSA-2003-33.txt","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A6","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/22619","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b37ddadc32d456372cb07846a95b411ce7a32d9f/cves/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0195.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2003/CVE-2003-0195","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37be0559d0574b93d433d6c01d9f77ea4c420519/CVE/data/2003/CVE-2003-0195.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2003/CVE-2003-0195.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/5d2b90135469e518b8bd9c7142a1d639da966b67/2003/CVE-2003-0195.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2003-0195.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1d7706ed603ab73481cbc20e5bea092e02e7c9be/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0195.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/e9b51a58e4ac0e6b00dc38147f459707e98ae056/CVE-2003/CVE-2003-01xx/CVE-2003-0195.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/98c311c3ba3abe1f72f8d5cfae5eb671ae60d00f/tracker/CVE/2003/CVE-2003-0195.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0195.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2003/AVE-2003-0062.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2003-0082","file_name":"2003/AVE-2003-0082.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2003-0357","title":"Ethereal 多个解析器整数溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Ethereal 0.9.11 及之前版本中存在多处整数溢出漏洞，具体位于 Mount 和 PPP 解析器中。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过发送特制的网络数据包触发该漏洞，导致解析器崩溃从而引发拒绝服务，在特定条件下可能进一步实现任意代码执行。该漏洞影响所有使用受影响版本的 Ethereal 网络协议分析软件，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2003-0357"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-06-09T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:02:03Z","remediation":"升级 Ethereal 至 0.9.12 或更高版本。Debian Woody 用户安装 ethereal 0.9.4-1woody4 安全更新。如无法升级，在协议解析设置中禁用 Mount 和 PPP 协议解析器，并在网络边界过滤未知或恶意网络流量作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2003-077.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-313","http://www.ethereal.com/appnotes/enpa-sa-00009.html","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/232164","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/361700","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2003:067","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/7494","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/7495","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A73","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a31aa101497b2d23391e84ef31f75e6600381dae/cves/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0357.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2003/CVE-2003-0357","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be7c9eef0523e112dce5fde0006bf85d14a40618/CVE/data/2003/CVE-2003-0357.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2003/CVE-2003-0357.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3355d48a7d0ca0d3b4124274995f7205f0bb89f2/2003/CVE-2003-0357.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2003-0357.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ca31171c444e5a175f3ac1833b0261c6587a34e9/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0357.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/9af727c40ac027294e4558abbc02d8967ee2a1d7/CVE-2003/CVE-2003-03xx/CVE-2003-0357.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/98c311c3ba3abe1f72f8d5cfae5eb671ae60d00f/tracker/CVE/2003/CVE-2003-0357.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0357.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2003/AVE-2003-0082.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2003-0081","file_name":"2003/AVE-2003-0081.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2003-0356","title":"Ethereal 多协议解析器越界远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Ethereal 0.9.11 及更早版本中存在多个 off-by-one（差一错误）漏洞，涉及 AIM、GIOP Gryphon、OSPF、PPTP、Quake、Quake2、Quake3、Rsync、SMB、SMPP 和 TSP 等协议解析器。这些解析器未能正确使用 tvb_get_nstringz 和 tvb_get_nstringz0 函数处理输入数据，导致远程攻击者可通过发送特制的网络数据包触发缓冲区溢出，造成拒绝服务，甚至可能执行任意代码。该漏洞影响范围广泛，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2003-0356"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-06-09T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:02:03Z","remediation":"立即升级 Ethereal 至 0.9.12 或更高版本。各发行版用户：Debian 安装 dsa-313 更新，Red Hat 安装 RHSA-2003:077 更新，Mandriva 安装 MDKSA-2003:067 更新。如无法升级，建议禁用 Ethereal 中对 AIM、OSPF、SMB 等存在漏洞的协议解析器，或改用 Wireshark 替代。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-313","http://www.ethereal.com/appnotes/enpa-sa-00009.html","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/641013","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2003:067","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-077.html","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A69","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a31aa101497b2d23391e84ef31f75e6600381dae/cves/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0356.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2003/CVE-2003-0356","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be7c9eef0523e112dce5fde0006bf85d14a40618/CVE/data/2003/CVE-2003-0356.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2003/CVE-2003-0356.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3355d48a7d0ca0d3b4124274995f7205f0bb89f2/2003/CVE-2003-0356.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ca31171c444e5a175f3ac1833b0261c6587a34e9/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0356.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2003-0356.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/98c311c3ba3abe1f72f8d5cfae5eb671ae60d00f/tracker/CVE/2003/CVE-2003-0356.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0356.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/9af727c40ac027294e4558abbc02d8967ee2a1d7/CVE-2003/CVE-2003-03xx/CVE-2003-0356.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2003/AVE-2003-0081.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2003-0079","file_name":"2003/AVE-2003-0079.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2003-0328","title":"EPIC IRC Client EPIC4 CTCP Nickname 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"EPIC4 IRC 客户端在处理来自恶意 IRC 服务器的 CTCP 请求时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。由于对超长昵称的长度计算错误，远程攻击者可通过向客户端发送特制的 CTCP 消息触发该漏洞，导致客户端崩溃（拒绝服务），在特定条件下可实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 EPIC4 pre2.002、pre2.003 及可能更早版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。目前已公开缓冲区溢出利用代码。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2003-0328"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-06-09T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:02:00Z","remediation":"建议升级 EPIC IRC Client (EPIC4) 至 pre2.004 或更高版本，或应用官方补丁 alloca_underrun-patch-1（下载地址 ftp://ftp.prbh.org/pub/epic/patches/alloca_underrun-patch-1）。Debian 用户应更新至 DSA-306/DSA-399 对应修复版本，Red Hat 用户安装 RHSA-2003-342 更新。临时缓解措施可在 IRC 服务器端限制客户端昵称长度。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-306","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-399","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-342.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/23366","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a31aa101497b2d23391e84ef31f75e6600381dae/cves/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0328.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be7c9eef0523e112dce5fde0006bf85d14a40618/CVE/data/2003/CVE-2003-0328.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2003/CVE-2003-0328","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2003/CVE-2003-0328.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2003-0328.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/abb3d9c240bc75ee9d5885882897d780d10d15cb/2003/CVE-2003-0328.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1d7706ed603ab73481cbc20e5bea092e02e7c9be/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0328.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b6c80ad7b47e52f64ae2ee2b20e56d7eaaaa57fe/CVE-2003/CVE-2003-03xx/CVE-2003-0328.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/98c311c3ba3abe1f72f8d5cfae5eb671ae60d00f/tracker/CVE/2003/CVE-2003-0328.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0328.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2003/AVE-2003-0079.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2003-0067","file_name":"2003/AVE-2003-0067.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2003-0245","title":"Apache APR apr_psprintf 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Apache Portable Runtime (APR) 库中的 apr_psprintf 函数存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，影响 Apache 2.0.37 至 2.0.45 版本。远程攻击者可通过向 mod_dav 模块发送特制的长字符串（如 XML 对象）触发该漏洞，导致服务进程崩溃，造成拒绝服务，在特定条件下可能实现任意代码执行。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程利用，攻击复杂度较低。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2003-0245"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-06-09T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:01:49Z","remediation":"升级 Apache 至 2.0.46 或更高版本（已修复 APR 库 apr_psprintf 缓冲区溢出问题），或手动更新 APR 库至 0.9.5 以上版本。若暂时无法升级，可在 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）层面限制过长的 XML 请求体长度（如限制 Content-Length ≤ 8MB），并禁用不必要的 mod_dav 模块以减少攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2003-q2/0095.html","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000661","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=105418115512559&w=2","http://www.apache.org/dist/httpd/Announcement2.h