2003/AVE-2003-0057.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2003-0188","title":"GNU lv 本地代码执行漏洞","description":"lv 文件查看器在处理 .lv 配置文件时存在路径搜索漏洞，程序默认从当前工作目录加载 .lv 文件而未限制搜索路径范围。本地攻击者可通过在其他目录中放置恶意的 .lv 配置文件，诱使其他 lv 用户在该目录下运行 lv 命令，从而以目标用户权限执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 lv 所有版本，攻击者需具备本地访问权限且能控制目标用户的工作目录，利用难度较低，可导致权限提升或敏感信息窃取。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2003-0188"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-06-09T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:01:43Z","remediation":"升级 lv 至修复版本：Debian 系统升级至 4.49.4-7（woody）或 4.49.5-2（unstable）及以上版本，Red Hat 系统安装 RHSA-2003-167/RHSA-2003-169 提供的更新包。如无法升级，可删除或限制用户对当前目录 .lv 文件的写入权限，或移除 lv 的 setuid 位作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-304","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-167.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-169.html","http://www.turbolinux.com/security/TLSA-2003-35.txt","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A430","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a14f4e66db68a75a9270d6c9081e9ffb7f931cd8/cves/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0188.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2003/CVE-2003-0188","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3eab0e512529a79daadefaadf0f05372813e7876/CVE/data/2003/CVE-2003-0188.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2003/CVE-2003-0188.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/2adf3d659b2229087465cbedc27cc02d5736df99/2003/CVE-2003-0188.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1d7706ed603ab73481cbc20e5bea092e02e7c9be/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0188.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2003-0188.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/98c311c3ba3abe1f72f8d5cfae5eb671ae60d00f/tracker/CVE/2003/CVE-2003-0188.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0188.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/e9b51a58e4ac0e6b00dc38147f459707e98ae056/CVE-2003/CVE-2003-01xx/CVE-2003-0188.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2003/AVE-2003-0057.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2003-0075","file_name":"2003/AVE-2003-0075.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2003-0255","title":"GNU GnuPG 多用户ID密钥可信路径验证漏洞","description":"GnuPG 1.2.2 之前版本中的密钥验证代码在处理包含多个用户 ID 的密钥时存在逻辑缺陷，错误地将所有用户 ID 中最高可信度赋值为整个密钥的有效性等级。远程攻击者可通过向目标用户发送精心构造的、包含不可信用户 ID 的密钥，绕过 GnuPG 对非可信路径用户 ID 的警告机制，诱导加密方使用不可信密钥进行加密通信，导致机密信息泄露。该漏洞影响所有 GnuPG 1.2.2 之前版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2003-0255"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-05-27T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:01:51Z","remediation":"立即升级 GnuPG 至 1.2.2 或更高版本。各发行版用户：Red Hat 执行 `up2date gnupg` 或安装 RHSA-2003:175/176 更新包；Debian/Ubuntu 执行 `apt-get update && apt-get install gnupg`；Gentoo 执行 `emerge --sync && emerge -u gnupg`；Mandriva 安装 MDKSA-2003:061 更新。如无法升级，避免使用多 User ID 的 GPG 密钥进行加密操作，并手动验证每个 User ID 的信任链。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000694","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=105215110111174&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=105301357425157&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=105311804129104&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=105362224514081&w=2","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/397604","http://www.linuxsecurity.com/advisories/engarde_advisory-3258.html","http://www.linuxsecurity.com/advisories/gentoo_advisory-3266.html","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2003:061","http://www.osvdb.org/4947","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-175.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-176.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/7497","http://www.turbolinux.com/security/TLSA-2003-34.txt","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/11930","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A135","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2003/CVE-2003-0255.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a31aa101497b2d23391e84ef31f75e6600381dae/cves/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0255.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2003/CVE-2003-0255","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be7c9eef0523e112dce5fde0006bf85d14a40618/CVE/data/2003/CVE-2003-0255.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2003/CVE-2003-0255.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/b5100979f8c44200a9b65976c3ddceb21c01ae6d/2003/CVE-2003-0255.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1d7706ed603ab73481cbc20e5bea092e02e7c9be/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0255.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2003-0255.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/98c311c3ba3abe1f72f8d5cfae5eb671ae60d00f/tracker/CVE/2003/CVE-2003-0255.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0255.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2003/AVE-2003-0075.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2003-0065","file_name":"2003/AVE-2003-0065.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2003-0244","title":"Linux 内核 Netfilter 远程拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux 2.4 内核的路由缓存实现及 Netfilter IP 连接跟踪模块存在哈希表碰撞漏洞，远程未经身份认证的攻击者可通过发送大量伪造源地址的恶意数据包，导致路由缓存哈希表发生严重碰撞，消耗目标系统大量 CPU 资源，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux 2.4 内核系列版本，攻击者无需任何认证即可远程触发，危害等级重要。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2003-0244"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-05-27T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:01:49Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 2.4.21 及以上版本，该版本已修复路由缓存哈希碰撞问题。如无法升级内核，可在边界防火墙上配置源地址验证（如 uRPF 反向路径过滤），丢弃源地址不合法的数据包；同时可调整 net.ipv4.conf.all.rp_filter=1 启用反向路径过滤作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2003-q2/0073.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=105301461726555&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=105595901923063&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=linux-kernel&m=104956079213417","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-311","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-312","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-332","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-336","http://www.debian.org/security/2004/dsa-442","http://www.enyo.de/fw/security/notes/linux-dst-cache-dos.html","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2003:066","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2003:074","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-145.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-147.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-172.html","http://www.secunia.com/advisories/8786/","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/7601","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/15382","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A261","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27584df20575115093a915d82c76b5107dd9d51e/cves/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0244.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2003/CVE-2003-0244","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2003-0244","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c31c0a9b9af147bd58078ebf7769418f19d3f2e1/CVE/data/2003/CVE-2003-0244.json","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2003-0244","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/2880bce38b1c3fec315752297be30e3d60dabff9/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2003-0244","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2003/CVE-2003-0244.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/cb4fa88be1e2cec066471c94ef8377b081c79cb6/2003/CVE-2003-0244.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1d7706ed603ab73481cbc20e5bea092e02e7c9be/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0244.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2003-0244.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2003/AVE-2003-0065.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2003-0059","file_name":"2003/AVE-2003-0059.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2003-0190","title":"OpenSSH OpenSSH-portable PAM 用户枚举漏洞","description":"OpenSSH-portable（OpenSSH）3.6.1p1 及更早版本在启用 PAM 支持时，当用户不存在时会立即发送错误消息，而存在的用户则需经过完整的 PAM 认证流程后才返回错误，这一响应时间差异使得远程攻击者可通过计时攻击（Timing Attack）枚举系统有效用户名。该漏洞影响所有启用 PAM 的 OpenSSH 3.6.1p1 及之前版本，攻击者无需认证即可利用，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。已公开的利用工具（ExploitDB ID: 25）可自动化完成用户名探测过程。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2003-0190"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-05-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:01:43Z","remediation":"升级 OpenSSH-portable 至 3.6.1p2 或更高版本，该版本已集成 Openwall 补丁，确保对不存在的用户名也执行 PAM 密码认证流程，消除响应时间差异。如无法升级，可在 /etc/pam.d/system-auth 中 pam_unix.so 行添加 nodelay 选项（如 auth sufficient /lib/security/pam_unix.so likeauth nullok nodelay），消除 pam_unix 模块的认证延迟差异。同时建议在 sshd_config 中禁用 PAMAuthenticationViaKbdInt 并限制 SSH 登录尝试频率作为纵深防御。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lab.mediaservice.net/advisory/2003-01-openssh.txt","http://lists.grok.org.uk/pipermail/full-disclosure/2003-April/004815.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=105172058404810&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=106018677302607&w=2","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-222.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-224.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/7467","http://www.turbolinux.com/security/TLSA-2003-31.txt","https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/pdf/ssa-412672.pdf","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A445","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/25","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2003/CVE-2003-0190.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2003/CVE-2003-1562.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2004/CVE-2004-2760.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a14f4e66db68a75a9270d6c9081e9ffb7f931cd8/cves/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0190.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2003/CVE-2003-0190.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2003/CVE-2003-0190.md","https://github.com/PwnAwan/CVEs/blob/967839a1f3dd2e43c3ca7af98749ae1712e69a04/2003/CVE-2003-0190.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2003/CVE-2003-0190","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2003/CVE-2003-0190.rules","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2003-0190"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2003/AVE-2003-0059.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2003-0028","file_name":"2003/AVE-2003-0028.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2003-0084","title":"Red Hat Enterprise Linux mod_auth_any 任意命令执行漏洞","description":"Red Hat Enterprise Linux 2.1 及其他操作系统中所包含的 mod_auth_any 认证模块存在参数转义缺陷，当该模块调用外部程序进行认证时，未能正确转义用户提供的参数，导致攻击者可通过在认证请求中注入 shell 元字符（如管道符、分号等）执行任意系统命令。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程利用，攻击者成功利用后可完全控制目标系统，影响范围包括使用 mod_auth_any 的各类 Linux 发行版。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2003-0084"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-05-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:01:29Z","remediation":"立即卸载 mod_auth_any 软件包，该模块已不再维护且存在严重命令注入漏洞。对于 Red Hat Enterprise Linux 2.1 系统，应升级至 Red Hat 官方提供的修复版本（如 mod_auth_any-1.3-1）或迁移至受支持的 RHEL 版本。替代方案是使用 mod_authz_core 或 mod_authn_file 等 Apache 内置认证模块，避免使用调用外部程序的第三方认证模块。同时检查 Apache 配置中所有 Auth_Any 指令，确保已移除或替换为安全实现。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2003-114.html","http://www.ciac.org/ciac/bulletins/n-090.shtml","http://www.itlab.musc.edu/webNIS/mod_auth_any.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-113.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/7448","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/11893","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f7f0337cfdc7d8aab4c9eb0d8a44be53baa8f88d/cves/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0084.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2003/CVE-2003-0084","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df225994fea2bf22c3b73491021c40bfd2f964e1/CVE/data/2003/CVE-2003-0084.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2003/CVE-2003-0084.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2003-0084.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/a8d9b19e8bcb98a5a7dedc851836a009f19fbc3e/2003/CVE-2003-0084.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/68a8e7c8b5d4a203080f3ef6d3d4e3df346511fe/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0084.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/d6e5bf87d27954c5a3cd48e565b212fb97932a81/CVE-2003/CVE-2003-00xx/CVE-2003-0084.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0084.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/2ea9851780633b2caab16fe048a14b38ca9a0b56/content/CVE-2003-0084.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2003/AVE-2003-0028.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2003-0077","file_name":"2003/AVE-2003-0077.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2003-0201","title":"Samba call_trans2open 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Samba 2.2.x 及更早版本的 trans2.c 文件中的 call_trans2open 函数存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向 Samba 服务发送特制的 trans2open 请求，触发栈缓冲区溢出，从而在目标系统上以 Samba 进程权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Samba 2.2.8a 之前的所有 2.2.x 版本、2.0.10 及更早的 2.0.x 版本以及 Samba-TNG 0.3.2 之前版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。已有公开的利用工具，攻击者可通过暴力枚举方式实现远程利用。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2003-0201"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-05-05T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:01:44Z","remediation":"立即升级 Samba 至 2.2.8a 及以上版本（2.2.x 分支）或 Samba-TNG 0.3.2 及以上版本。如无法立即升级，可在 smb.conf 中设置 `bind interfaces only = yes` 并限制 SMB 服务仅监听内网接口，同时在防火墙层面封禁 TCP 端口 139 和 445 的外部访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000624","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104972664226781&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104974612519064&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104981682014565&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104994564212488&w=2","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-280","http://www.digitaldefense.net/labs/advisories/DDI-1013.txt","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/267873","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2003:044","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2003_025_samba.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-137.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/7294","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A2163","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A567","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/22471","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2003/CVE-2003-0201.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/0cbbfd20018b392e9b69a82c4ac1297203bfeefd/2003/CVE-2003-0201.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/ab6f9d01ebd789d88d6c9c80d2c4801a89e1f38f/2003/CVE-2003-0201.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2003/CVE-2003-0201.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b37ddadc32d456372cb07846a95b411ce7a32d9f/cves/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0201.json","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2003/CVE-2003-0201.md","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/23441ec855d45e03157b693d7c6d0ff023fe3af5/2003/CVE-2003-0201/README.md","https://github.com/PwnAwan/CVEs/blob/967839a1f3dd2e43c3ca7af98749ae1712e69a04/2003/CVE-2003-0201.md","https://github.com/x0rz/EQGRP/blob/0c2354ff1073099b2aa417030b3167ec29d7279c/README.md","https://github.com/ycdxsb/PocOrExp_in_Github/blob/6ddf9a1b608eec5955a8f9e2e6551df06ce56068/2003/README.md","https://github.com/KernelPan1k/trans2open-CVE-2003-0201","https://github.com/Bakr-Ht/samba-trans2open-exploit-report","https://github.com/americooo/pentest-writeups","https://github.com/deepakkcybersec-eng/Kioptrix-Level1-Vulnerability-Analysis"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2003/AVE-2003-0077.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2003-0066","file_name":"2003/AVE-2003-0066.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2003-0196","title":"Samba 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Samba 2.2.8a 之前版本存在多处缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络向 Samba 服务发送特制请求触发缓冲区溢出，导致任意代码执行或拒绝服务。该漏洞影响所有 Samba 2.2.8a 之前版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。攻击者可通过 SMB/CIFS 协议端口（139/445）发送恶意构造的数据包实现远程利用，建议用户立即升级至 2.2.8a 或更高版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2003-0196"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-05-05T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:01:44Z","remediation":"立即升级 Samba 至 2.2.8a 或更高版本，该版本修复了多个缓冲区溢出漏洞。如无法升级，可在 smb.conf 中限制可访问的 IP 范围（hosts allow = 127.0.0.1 192.168.0.0/16），并禁用不必要共享服务以降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z",